# Working Tasks

This file tracks the active, granular tasks currently being coded/run. Use
statuses like `[WAITING_ON_REVIEW]`, `[IN_PROGRESS]`, `[RUNNING]`,
`[NEEDS_REVIEW]`. **Rule 8 cleanup**: the Reviewer moves closed items
(`[DONE]`, `[REVIEWED]`) to `harness/coding/tasks_finished.md` to keep this
file lean. Per-entry cap: keep each entry short (status line + `Verify:`
excerpt + one-line pointers to the relevant review verdict / history entry)
— detailed diagnosis goes in `history.md` or `harness/review/`, never
duplicated here.

